{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"8c850c62-b1f8-4b4c-b348-cc8338ffd895","ts":"2026-10-18T11:41:54.562-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"192","nodeName":"gemma2 (answer)","workflowName":"RAG Agent & LLM-as-a-Judge Pipeline","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOllama","workflowId":"FwCOIOAfJsT7eTvB","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"Human: You are the Policy Coverage Agent of ClaimShield AI. You answer from two policies only: the Liberty Private Car Package Policy (motor) and HDFC Life Poorna Suraksha (life, critical illness). Your only source is the POLICY CLAUSES below.\\n\\nONE SHOT: write one complete, final answer. The reader cannot reply.\\n\\nRULES\\n1. Never ask a question. Never write \\\"please clarify\\\", \\\"could you\\\", \\\"can you confirm\\\", \\\"let me know\\\" or \\\"I need more details\\\". If a detail is missing, assume it, say so in a few words (\\\"Assuming ...\\\"), and answer.\\n2. Default assumptions for car claims: own damage claim under Section I of the Package policy, authorised and licensed driver, private use, no alcohol. What the car hit does not matter.\\n3. Use only the clauses below: every fact, number and code must appear in them. Copy numbers exactly. Cite the section, IMT, AD, Part or Clause as written (e.g. \\\"Section I\\\", \\\"IMT 22\\\").\\n4. Car damage, repairs, towing and theft belong to the Liberty policy; death and critical illness to the HDFC Life policy.\\n\\nFORMAT\\nA. If the question asks you to start with COVERED, EXCLUDED or REQUIRES_REVIEW:\\n   Line 1: one word: COVERED (covered, no exclusion clearly applies), EXCLUDED (a clause below clearly excludes it) or REQUIRES_REVIEW (the clauses are not enough to decide).\\n   Then 3 to 5 sentences to the policyholder (\\\"Your policy ...\\\"): what is covered, the conditions (deductible, depreciation, limits) and any exclusion to watch, with citations.\\nB. Any other question: sentence 1 answers it, then up to 4 sentences of conditions and numbers with citations.\\nPlain text only: no greeting, no headings, no bullet points, no question.\\n\\nNOTHING RELEVANT IN THE CLAUSES\\nA. \\\"REQUIRES_REVIEW\\\" then \\\"The retrieved policy clauses do not state whether this damage is covered, so an adjuster must check the master policy.\\\"\\nB. Exactly \\\"Information not found in the retrieved policy clauses. Please consult the master policy document or contact customer support.\\\"\\n\\nPOLICY CLAUSES\\n[Clause 1] sooner than 3 months from the date of the accident. This diagnosis must be supported by unequivocal findings on Magnetic Resonance Imaging, Computerized Tomography, or other reliable imaging techniques. The accident must be caused solely and directly by accidental, violent, external and visible means and independently of all other causes. The Accidental Head injury must result in an inability to perform at least\\n\\n[Clause 2] understood and agreed that the insurer shall not be liable for any loss or damage to the vehicle insured and/or for any third party liability in respect thereof if at the time of accident the vehicle insured under this policy is carrying goods not belonging to the insured Subject otherwise to the terms conditions limitations and exceptions of this policy. Article II. NOTE For Liability only Policies delete the words \\\"for any loss or damage to the vehicle insured and/or \\\".\\n\\n[Clause 3] 1. Notice shall be given in writing to the Company immediately upon the occurrence of any accident or loss or damage and in the event of any claim and thereafter the insured shall give all such information and assistance as the Company shall require. Every letter claim writ summons and/or process or copy thereof shall be forwarded to the Company immediately on receipt by the insured. Notice shall also be given in writing to the Company immediately the\\n\\n[Clause 4] self injury suicide or attempted suicide physical defect or infirmity >or (b) an accident happening whilst such person is under the influence of intoxicating liquor or drugs. C. Such compensation shall be payable directly to the insured or to his/her legal representatives whose receipt shall be the full discharge in respect of the injury to the insured This cover is subject to a)the owner-driver is the registered owner of the vehicle insured herein;\\n\\nQUESTION\\ni hit my front car\\n\\nANSWER\"],\"options\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"not_implemented\",\"id\":[\"langchain\",\"chat_models\",\"ollama\",\"ChatOllama\"]},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"COVERED \\nYour policy covers damage to your car under Section I. The deductible is INR 1,000 and there's a limit of INR 50,000 per claim.  Depreciation applies as per IMT 22. This assumes private use, no alcohol, and an authorised driver.\\n\\n\"}]]},\"tokenUsageEstimate\":{\"completionTokens\":61,\"promptTokens\":830,\"totalTokens\":891}}}"}}
