{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"e3cdfebb-9332-47cb-ae73-b99e27a6011c","ts":"2026-10-18T11:42:11.293-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"192","nodeName":"gemma2 (judge)","workflowName":"RAG Agent & LLM-as-a-Judge Pipeline","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOllama","workflowId":"FwCOIOAfJsT7eTvB","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"Human: You are a strict QA Compliance Evaluator for an Insurance RAG System.\\n\\nUSER QUERY:\\ni hit my front car\\n\\nAGENT RESPONSE TO EVALUATE:\\nCOVERED \\nYour policy covers damage to your car under Section I. The deductible is INR 1,000 and there's a limit of INR 50,000 per claim.  Depreciation applies as per IMT 22. This assumes private use, no alcohol, and an authorised driver.\\n\\nEVALUATION RULES:\\n1. PASS CONDITION (\\\"pass\\\": true): The response MUST contain explicit insurance policy facts, numerical values, clause references, or specific terms (e.g., waiting periods, depreciation %, IMT codes, cover limits) retrieved from the database.\\n2. FAIL CONDITION (\\\"pass\\\": false): If the response contains any fallback disclaimer (e.g., \\\"Information not found\\\", \\\"consult customer support\\\"), refusals, small talk, or general non-policy answers, it is INVALID (\\\"pass\\\": false).\\n\\nOutput ONLY one JSON object with the keys score, pass and reasoning:\\n- If valid policy facts are present:\\n  {\\\"score\\\": 5, \\\"pass\\\": true, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Response contains verified policy clauses.\\\"}\\n- If fallback text, refusal, or missing policy context:\\n  {\\\"score\\\": 1, \\\"pass\\\": false, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Response contains fallback disclaimer or lacks retrieved policy context.\\\"}\"],\"options\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"not_implemented\",\"id\":[\"langchain\",\"chat_models\",\"ollama\",\"ChatOllama\"]},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"{\\\"score\\\": 5, \\\"pass\\\": true, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Response contains verified policy clauses. \\\"}\"}]]},\"tokenUsageEstimate\":{\"completionTokens\":23,\"promptTokens\":285,\"totalTokens\":308}}}"}}
