{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"ebb7a1b0-226c-458a-bbc3-e778dcafa07c","ts":"2026-10-18T11:49:13.762-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"198","nodeName":"gemma2 (judge)","workflowName":"RAG Agent & LLM-as-a-Judge Pipeline","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOllama","workflowId":"FwCOIOAfJsT7eTvB","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"Human: You are a strict QA Compliance Evaluator for an Insurance RAG System.\\n\\nUSER QUERY:\\nMotor insurance claim under the Liberty Private Car Package Policy.\\nDate of the accident: 2026-10-18 at 18:40.\\nWhat happened, in the policyholder's words: when i was waiting in trafic light i got hit from the side by a car \\r\\nthe doors are damaged from the left side the wind shield is broken an i the wheel is damaged\\nIs this damage covered by the policy? Search the policy first.\\nStart your answer with exactly one of these words: COVERED, EXCLUDED or REQUIRES_REVIEW.\\nThen, in three to five sentences addressed to the policyholder, explain what the policy says about this case:\\nwhat is covered, the conditions that apply and any exclusion that could apply.\\nCite the section, IMT or AD codes you relied on.\\n\\nAGENT RESPONSE TO EVALUATE:\\nCOVERED \\nYour policy covers damage to your car caused by a collision with another vehicle while in use for private purposes. Section I of the Liberty Private Car Package Policy will indemnify you for this loss, subject to the terms and conditions outlined in IMT 22. This includes repairs to damaged doors, windshield, and wheels. However, there is a compulsory deductible that applies as per IMT 22.\\n\\nEVALUATION RULES:\\n1. PASS CONDITION (\\\"pass\\\": true): The response MUST contain explicit insurance policy facts, numerical values, clause references, or specific terms (e.g., waiting periods, depreciation %, IMT codes, cover limits) retrieved from the database.\\n2. FAIL CONDITION (\\\"pass\\\": false): If the response contains any fallback disclaimer (e.g., \\\"Information not found\\\", \\\"consult customer support\\\"), refusals, small talk, or general non-policy answers, it is INVALID (\\\"pass\\\": false).\\n\\nOutput ONLY one JSON object with the keys score, pass and reasoning:\\n- If valid policy facts are present:\\n  {\\\"score\\\": 5, \\\"pass\\\": true, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Response contains verified policy clauses.\\\"}\\n- If fallback text, refusal, or missing policy context:\\n  {\\\"score\\\": 1, \\\"pass\\\": false, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Response contains fallback disclaimer or lacks retrieved policy context.\\\"}\"],\"options\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"not_implemented\",\"id\":[\"langchain\",\"chat_models\",\"ollama\",\"ChatOllama\"]},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"{\\\"score\\\": 4, \\\"pass\\\": true, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Response mentions relevant policy sections and IMT codes but lacks specific details like deductible amount or cover limits.\\\"}\"}]]},\"tokenUsageEstimate\":{\"completionTokens\":37,\"promptTokens\":463,\"totalTokens\":500}}}"}}
