photo fingerprints and dates):\\n{\\n  \\\"stage\\\": \\\"validate\\\",\\n  \\\"claim_id\\\": \\\"CLM-20261018-154758\\\",\\n  \\\"valid\\\": true,\\n  \\\"reasons\\\": [],\\n  \\\"checked_at\\\": \\\"2026-10-18T15:47:59.078Z\\\",\\n  \\\"photo_checks\\\": {\\n    \\\"photos_checked\\\": 1,\\n    \\\"photo_reused\\\": false,\\n    \\\"reused_from_claims\\\": [],\\n    \\\"photo_taken_dates\\\": [],\\n    \\\"photos_without_date\\\": [\\n      \\\"car-door-damaged-and-dented-after-traffic-accident-crash-3EJ6MKK.jpg\\\"\\n    ]\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nVISUAL INSPECTION RESULT (accident_description = the accident as seen on the photos):\\n{\\n  \\\"claim_id\\\": \\\"CLM-20261018-154758\\\",\\n  \\\"asset_type\\\": \\\"vehicle\\\",\\n  \\\"damage_severity\\\": 3,\\n  \\\"damaged_items\\\": [\\n    \\\"door_rear_left\\\",\\n    \\\"quarter_panel_rear_left\\\",\\n    \\\"side_window\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"damage_location\\\": \\\"left_side\\\",\\n  \\\"damage_cause_observed\\\": \\\"collision\\\",\\n  \\\"matches_description\\\": true,\\n  \\\"mismatch_reason\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"pre_existing_damage_signs\\\": true,\\n  \\\"pre_existing_reason\\\": \\\"Significant rust and corrosion are visible along the lower door sill and rocker panel, as well as rust forming inside the upper door crease.\\\",\\n  \\\"same_asset_across_photos\\\": true,\\n  \\\"asset_inconsistency_reason\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n  \\\"suspicious_image_flags\\\": [\\n    \\\"stock photo watermark\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"confidence\\\": 0.7,\\n  \\\"summary\\\": \\\"The photo shows severe impact damage to the rear left door and quarter panel of a silver sedan, along with a shattered side window and prominent stock photo watermarks.\\\",\\n  \\\"accident_description\\\": \\\"The vehicle has sustained a lateral impact to the rear left side, deeply denting the rear left door and warping the door frame. The rear quarter panel around the wheel arch is deformed and scraped, and the rear door window has completely shattered. The presence of rust along the damage points suggests potential pre-existing wear or aged damage.\\\",\\n  \\\"duplicate_photo_detected\\\": false,\\n  \\\"duplicate_photos\\\": [],\\n  \\\"damaged_parts\\\": [\\n    \\\"door_rear_left\\\",\\n    \\\"quarter_panel_rear_left\\\",\\n    \\\"side_window\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"photo_reused\\\": false,\\n  \\\"reused_from_claims\\\": [],\\n  \\\"same_vehicle_across_photos\\\": true\\n}\\n\\nINVOICE RESULT (summary = what the invoice says):\\n{\\n  \\\"error\\\": true,\\n  \\\"error_message\\\": \\\"access to env vars denied\\\"\\n}\\n\\nPOLICY COVERAGE RESULT:\\n{\\n  \\\"coverage_status\\\": \\\"COVERED\\\",\\n  \\\"cited_clauses\\\": [\\n    \\\"Section I\\\",\\n    \\\"IMT 22\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"COVERED \\\\nYour policy covers damage to your car caused by a collision with another vehicle while in use for private purposes. Section I of the Liberty Private Car Package Policy will indemnify you for this loss, subject to the terms and conditions outlined in IMT 22. This includes repairs to damaged doors, windshield, and wheels. However, there is a compulsory deductible that applies as per IMT 22.\\\"\\n}\\n\\nINCIDENT PLAUSIBILITY RESULT (the story checked against the map, the weather and the invoiced parts):\\n{\\n  \\\"summary\\\": \\\"No warning signs: the story is consistent with the map, the weather and the invoice. Some checks were skipped (the address was not found on the map).\\\",\\n  \\\"warning_signs\\\": []\\n}\\n\\nWARNING SIGNS ALREADY SCORED BY RULES (rule score 10/60):\\n[\\n  {\\n    \\\"code\\\": \\\"PRE_EXISTING_DAMAGE\\\",\\n    \\\"points\\\": 10,\\n    \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Significant rust and corrosion are visible along the lower door sill and rocker panel, as well as rust forming inside the upper door crease.\\\"\\n  }\\n]\\n\\nRULES FOR YOUR ANSWER:\\n1. llm_adjustment is an integer from 0 to 40. Use 0 when you find nothing beyond the rules.\\n2. Never re-count a warning sign that is already listed above.\\n3. Every point you add must be explained in justification, citing the specific fields that support it.\\n4. Base your answer only on the data above. Do not guess.\\n5. Example concerns: claimed amount far above what the damage severity suggests, impact zone that does not fit the description, an accident time or description that does not fit what the photos show, invoiced work that does not fit the described accident.\\n\\nReturn ONLY a raw JSON object, with no markdown and no text around it:\\n{\\n  \\\"llm_adjustment\\\": <integer 0-40>,\\n  \\\"justification\\\": \\\"<one or two sentences>\\\",\\n  \\\"additional_concerns\\\": [\\\"<short concern>\\\"]\\n}\"],\"options\":{\"google_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"GOOGLE_API_KEY\"]},\"base_url\":\"https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com\",\"model\":\"gemini-3.7-flash\",\"temperature\":0.2},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"{\\n  \\\"llm_adjustment\\\": 40,\\n  \\\"justification\\\": \\\"The submitted photo is an online stock photo featuring visible watermarks and a stock repository filename, and the claim was submitted at 15:47:58, several hours before the stated incident time of 18:40 on the same day.\\\",\\n  \\\"additional_concerns\\\": [\\n    \\\"Visual inspection identified prominent stock photo watermarks on the damage image\\\",\\n    \\\"Claim submission timestamp precedes the reported incident datetime\\\",\\n    \\\"Claimed damage to the windshield and wheel is not corroborated by the photo analysis, which shows rear left side damage\\\"\\n  ]\\n}\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"STOP\",\"index\":0}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":141,\"promptTokens\":1669,\"totalTokens\":1810}}}"}}
